{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-5882ec", "type": "material"}, "note": "嗅覚の対象に固有の名を与えない点で一致する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-eeb1d0", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-bdae5e", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-5882ec", "type": "material"}, "note": "種を持たない半ば形成のもの／流出する粒子。説明の粒度が違う。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-b2da00", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-2eed5b", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-2eed5b", "type": "material"}, "note": "受け取る体の差と、名づける言語の差。どちらも対象ではなく受け手を問題にする。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-3e1884", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-48a9cc", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-62d9e2", "type": "material"}, "note": "嗅覚を共有できない感覚、あるいは近さの感覚として社会の側へ置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-7d6dcb", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-38421f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-38421f", "type": "material"}, "note": "社会形式としての抑制／人類史の有機的抑圧。同じ「抑圧」でも根拠が違う。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-2ae49e", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-a614d9", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-a614d9", "type": "material"}, "note": "抑圧と隠蔽。匂いを語らないことが、匂いを消すことになる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-012d69", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-7aa03b", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-7aa03b", "type": "material"}, "note": "隠される身体と、都市の外縁へ置かれる臭い仕事。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-c328e7", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-6fe53f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-122d67", "type": "material"}, "note": "五感を分けない現象学／嗅覚を一つの系として記述する生物学。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-923e50", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-e5d88e", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-e5d88e", "type": "material"}, "note": "語彙の乏しさを、感覚ではなく言語の側の制約として扱う。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-ac3e99", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-48a9cc", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-5882ec", "type": "material"}, "note": "名を持たない感覚という古代の定式と、5回という計数。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-a5f0f9", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-b9728b", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-4ad310", "type": "material"}, "note": "薫物を分類する語彙と、移り香で人を同定する語彙。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-b6b90a", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-2f5550", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-2f5550", "type": "material"}, "note": "香りで誰かを当てる。物語の同定と組香の照合。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-16b5f3", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-a34982", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-dbfcdd", "type": "material"}, "note": "処方される香と、贈られ、死に添えられる香。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-9ef1bd", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-17f624", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-17f624", "type": "material"}, "note": "死に香を添える／死の匂いを郊外へ移す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-9462b2", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-adda3d", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-8760e7", "type": "material"}, "note": "匂いで隠せない罪と、匂いで覆われる腐敗。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-534700", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-a9c4ad", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-81bf48", "type": "material"}, "note": "感覚間の翻訳を信じる詩／言語による名づけの差を測る実験。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d9f73a", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-48a9cc", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-a9c4ad", "type": "material"}, "note": "匂いで人格を作る。隠す場合と、作る場合。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-655b04", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-0620da", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-c372e8", "type": "material"}, "note": "匂いが知識の経路になる条件。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-af70f2", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-e5d88e", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-0620da", "type": "material"}, "note": "自分の匂いを持たない者が匂いを蒐集する。書庫の位置の小説版。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-2bfa03", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-b9728b", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-2f5550", "type": "material"}, "note": "人の移り香／紙の匂い。匂いの主が人から素材へ移る。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d9f825", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "FRAG-035", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-07000d", "type": "material"}, "note": "匂いを証拠にしない推理と、匂いが政治を動かす事件。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d02470", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-73775f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-07000d", "type": "material"}, "note": "嗅覚の誤りを正す地図／嗅覚に代わる濃度の基準。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-5c981f", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-46f3bc", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-e95e2b", "type": "material"}, "note": "匂いの閾値の歴史と、臭い仕事の空間配置。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-2c14eb", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-6fe53f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-08b2b0", "type": "material"}, "note": "都市の下に集められる、隠されたもの。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-18a114", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-13aa6f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-13aa6f", "type": "material"}, "note": "死の匂いを都市の外へ移す二つの制度。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-ccf0df", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-adda3d", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-f421b0", "type": "material"}, "note": "瘴気の防御／土に戻す資源。同じ匂いの正負が逆。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-737e83", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-b6bf0c", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-b6bf0c", "type": "material"}, "note": "匂いの価値の逆転。資源になる臭いとならない臭い。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-8e3116", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-6fe53f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-46f3bc", "type": "material"}, "note": "濃度で測る／地図に置く。嗅覚を外部化する二つの形式。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-f34330", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-7eb053", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-e95e2b", "type": "material"}, "note": "感じやすさの歴史と、隠すことの歴史。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-529332", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-7aa03b", "type": "material"}}
